#: packages/woocommerce-admin/src/Notes/OnlineClothingStore.php:82
msgid "Starting a fashion website is exciting but it may seem overwhelming as well. In this article, we'll walk you through the setup process, teach you to create successful product listings, and show you how to market to your ideal audience."
msgstr "Obrir un lloc web de moda és emocionant, però també pot ser aclaparador. En aquest article us guiarem a través del procés de configuració, us ensenyarem a crear llistes de productes exitoses i us mostrarem com vendre al vostre públic ideal."

#: packages/woocommerce-admin/src/Notes/OnlineClothingStore.php:81
